/* 二维码识别（增强版：多尺度 + 灰度二值化 + 反色尝试，兼容淘宝/饿了么富媒体码） */
function recognizeQrFromDataUrl(dataUrl, cb){
  var img=new Image();
  img.onload=function(){
    var W=img.naturalWidth||img.width, H=img.naturalHeight||img.height;
    if(!W||!H){ cb(''); return; }
    var cands=[{w:W,h:H}];
    if(W>900){ var k=900/W; cands.push({w:900,h:Math.round(H*k)}); }
    if(W<500){ var k2=Math.min(3,1000/W); cands.push({w:Math.round(W*k2),h:Math.round(H*k2)}); }
    var found=null;
    for(var s=0;s<cands.length&&!found;s++){
      var c=document.createElement('canvas');
      c.width=cands[s].w; c.height=cands[s].h;
      var ctx=c.getContext('2d',{willReadFrequently:true});
      ctx.drawImage(img,0,0,c.width,c.height);
      var run=function(invert){
        try{
          var d=ctx.getImageData(0,0,c.width,c.height);
          if(invert){
            for(var i=0;i<d.data.length;i+=4){
              d.data[i]=255-d.data[i]; d.data[i+1]=255-d.data[i+1]; d.data[i+2]=255-d.data[i+2];
            }
            ctx.putImageData(d,0,0);
            d=ctx.getImageData(0,0,c.width,c.height);
          }
          var qr=jsQR(d.data,d.width,d.height,{inversionAttempts:'attemptBoth'});
          if(qr&&qr.data) return qr.data;
          var d2=ctx.getImageData(0,0,c.width,c.height);
          var px=d2.data;
          for(var j=0;j<px.length;j+=4){
            var g=px[j]*0.299+px[j+1]*0.587+px[j+2]*0.114;
            var v=g>128?255:0;
            px[j]=px[j+1]=px[j+2]=v;
          }
          ctx.putImageData(d2,0,0);
          var qr2=jsQR(d2.data,d2.width,d2.height,{inversionAttempts:'attemptBoth'});
          return qr2&&qr2.data;
        }catch(e){ return null; }
      };
      found=run(false);
      if(!found) found=run(true);
    }
    cb(found||'');
  };
  img.onerror=function(){ cb(''); };
  img.src=dataUrl;
}
function applyQrRecognized(txt){
  if(txt){
    var isUrl=/^https?:\/\//i.test(txt);
    if($('qrResult')) $('qrResult').innerHTML='<span style="color:#16A34A;">✅ 已识别'+(isUrl?'链接':'内容')+'：'+esc(txt.slice(0,60))+'</span>';
    window.__scrapeQR=txt;
    if(isUrl&&$('shopLink')) $('shopLink').value=txt;
  }else{
    if($('qrResult')) $('qrResult').innerHTML='<span style="color:#B45309;">⚠️ 未能自动识别。可用手机「微信/饿了么App」扫该二维码，把显示的链接粘贴到输入框</span>';
    window.__scrapeQR='';
  }
}
function bindQrInput(inputEl){
  if(!inputEl) return;
  inputEl.addEventListener('change',function(){
    var f=this.files&&this.files[0]; this.value='';
    if(!f) return;
    var rd=new FileReader();
    rd.onload=function(){ recognizeQrFromDataUrl(rd.result, applyQrRecognized); };
    rd.readAsDataURL(f);
  });
}
