/* 解析 m.tb.cn 口令链接 -> 真实店铺链接（页面HTML内嵌 shopId，跨域用 CORS 代理抓取） */
function resolveTaoLink(shortUrl){
  var proxies=[
    'https://api.allorigins.win/raw?url='+encodeURIComponent(shortUrl),
    'https://corsproxy.io/?url='+encodeURIComponent(shortUrl),
    'https://api.codetabs.com/v1/proxy?quest='+encodeURIComponent(shortUrl)
  ];
  return new Promise(function(res){
    var i=0;
    function next(){
      if(i>=proxies.length){ res(''); return; }
      var p=proxies[i++];
      fetch(p, {mode:'cors'}).then(function(r){ return r.text(); }).then(function(html){
        var m=(html||'').match(/shopId=([A-Za-z0-9]+)/);
        if(m && m[1]) res(makeShopUrl(m[1]));
        else next();
      })['catch'](function(){ next(); });
    }
    next();
  });
}
function makeShopUrl(shopId){
  var lat=localStorage.getItem('cmz_lat')||'31.222007';
  var lng=localStorage.getItem('cmz_lng')||'121.353007';
  return 'https://h5.ele.me/2021001185671035/pages/ele-takeout-index/ele-takeout-index?from=mobile.default&psc=24901&type=1&scheme_type=SHOP_SCHEME&latitude='+lat+'&longitude='+lng+'&shopId='+shopId;
}
